{"start":"t:body","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:attah_hu_eloheinu","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n132.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n132.jpg","n":"52"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:attah_hu_eloheinu/1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Thou art our God in heaven and on earth. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:attah_hu_eloheinu/2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Mighty and awe-inspiring distinguished among myriads. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:attah_hu_eloheinu/3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He spoke and it came to pass, He commanded, then were they created. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:attah_hu_eloheinu/4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"His memory is forever, He lives in all eternity. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:attah_hu_eloheinu/5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Pure is His gaze, He is enthroned in mystery. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:attah_hu_eloheinu/6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"His crown is salvation, His robe is righteousness. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:attah_hu_eloheinu/7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"His cloak is zeal, He is girded with retribution. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:attah_hu_eloheinu/8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"His mystery is equity, His counsel faith. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:attah_hu_eloheinu/9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"His work is truth, He is just and upright. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:attah_hu_eloheinu/10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He is close to those who call Him in truth, lofty and exalted. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:attah_hu_eloheinu/11"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He resides in the clouds and suspends the earth in space. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:attah_hu_eloheinu/12"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Living, enduring, awe-inspiring, lofty and holy. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n      "}
{"end":"t:div"}
{"tail":"\n    "}
{"end":"t:body"}
